sequenceDiagram
    participant Engine
    participant Store
    participant Supervisor
    Engine->>Store: Recheck current caps and reserve estimate
    Store-->>Engine: Commit reservation and queued attempt
    Engine->>Store: Lease attempt with fence
    Engine->>Supervisor: Start reviewed work and meter usage
    Supervisor-->>Engine: Observed usage and bounded outcome
    Engine->>Store: Validate fence, settle once and append events
    alt Duplicate completion or stale fence
        Store-->>Engine: Return prior outcome or deny stale publication
    else Observed overrun
        Store-->>Engine: Record deviation and close admission
    end
